def sha(s):return hashlib.sha256(s.encode()).hexdigest()
def main():
 raw=PACK.read_bytes();p=loads(raw)
 if any(r['itemId']=='prov-ca-u26-letter-capability' for r in p['provenanceRecords']):print('Already repaired');return
 obj='obj-u26-letter-writing';u=next(u for u in p['units'] if u['number']==26);o=next(o for o in u['objectives'] if o['id']==obj);s=next(s for s in u['sessions'] if s['id']=='u26-s-letter-writing');title='Apply a supplied letter framework without universal style rules';o['title']=s['title']=title
 cards=[('Organize the supplied problem-and-request letter',"In this lesson's problem-and-request model, state the reason, explain relevant facts, then make the request. For a letter explaining a problem and requesting action, this sequence gives the recipient a reason and relevant support for the request. It is a supplied framework, not a rule that every Russian letter must put its main point last. English and Russian letters have different genres and purposes; a source's contrast is not a universal rule for either language."),('Distinguish the greeting, body and closing',"Здравствуйте! is a greeting, not a rule about how close the recipient is. The retained example glosses it as Greetings. Уважаемый Иван Иванович is another supplied address formula, glossed Respected Ivan Ivanovich. Select address wording for the recipient, relationship and genre; the English word dear is not a universal ban determined by this neutral greeting. The claim every unfamiliar recipient forbids any greeting translated as dear overgeneralizes from one greeting to every addressee. In the supplied layout, Sender’s address and date precedes the Greeting, then comes the Body, followed by Closing and signature. A greeting starts the address to the reader; the body carries the message; the closing and signature end the letter. The framework is not mandatory for every letter or electronic message.")]
